{"id":"ccbc12:problem:f-p2030","answer":"AGE INCREMENT","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>这是2030年的街景，和现在的街景基本相同。所有的街景都能在百度地图中找到。</p>","text":"这是2030年的街景，和现在的街景基本相同。所有的街景都能在百度地图中找到。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"能简化一下吗","html":"<p>九张街景所在的城市分别为上海、广州、天津、深圳、厦门、重庆、杭州、长沙、北京。</p>","text":"九张街景所在的城市分别为上海、广州、天津、深圳、厦门、重庆、杭州、长沙、北京。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>找找和现实版有什么不一样的？不一样的中又有什么是一样的？</p>\n<p>顺带一提，这道题的答案不止九个字母。</p>","text":"找找和现实版有什么不一样的？不一样的中又有什么是一样的？\n\n顺带一提，这道题的答案不止九个字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>简易版“网络迷踪”。可以根据地上的方向箭头、拼合的照片等常见特征推测，所有街景图片均来自于百度实景地图，需要根据街景图片中的线索寻找到这些实景的位置：</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-ef0aa9813d4c2d3db99fd89f\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-1.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-475aa275f0410f64f3230115\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-2.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-a25102af9903de874ca6ad1f\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-3.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-c3e3c687447ba2b89087e642\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-4.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-094da935ba47c61cbb90ee59\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-5.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-eb05e736539a25fc182a0e3c\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-6.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-beae9f6742ce786f7daa825e\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-7.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-758efbb06f6bc224fcc0d024\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-8.png\"/></p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-3b0b6fa66e2da66e2cbec194\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-9.png\"/></p>\n<p>对比所有建筑上的原字母与图片中的字母，发现每组字母均有1-2个字母没有变动，提取这些字母后按图片顺序连起来可得答案：<strong>AGE INCREMENT</strong>。</p>","text":"简易版“网络迷踪”。可以根据地上的方向箭头、拼合的照片等常见特征推测，所有街景图片均来自于百度实景地图，需要根据街景图片中的线索寻找到这些实景的位置：\n\n对比所有建筑上的原字母与图片中的字母，发现每组字母均有1-2个字母没有变动，提取这些字母后按图片顺序连起来可得答案：\nAGE INCREMENT\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-094da935ba47c61cbb90ee59","asset-3b0b6fa66e2da66e2cbec194","asset-475aa275f0410f64f3230115","asset-758efbb06f6bc224fcc0d024","asset-a25102af9903de874ca6ad1f","asset-beae9f6742ce786f7daa825e","asset-c3e3c687447ba2b89087e642","asset-eb05e736539a25fc182a0e3c","asset-ef0aa9813d4c2d3db99fd89f"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-094da935ba47c61cbb90ee59","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-5.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-5.png","mime":"image/png","size":575639,"sha256":"af4d884bf77799a6f64a50a72f5f0d41762d27e1178aeffd163dbd7afe9339ad","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-3b0b6fa66e2da66e2cbec194","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-9.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-9.png","mime":"image/png","size":562064,"sha256":"321675b21ae3094306b7e62065ab1eae1eaf4cf84bcbe2aef835fffdb49acc3f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-475aa275f0410f64f3230115","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-2.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-2.png","mime":"image/png","size":499221,"sha256":"84270b26779d291f21c9a94b056197cb220d951a2280b3cf2cacc158a9dcdfec","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-758efbb06f6bc224fcc0d024","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-2030-8.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipher